WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:06.650
OMB M-19-17 is the federal policy for
identity, credential and access management.

2
00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:12.525
It tells agencies to run identity as one
program, to manage devices and automated

3
00:00:12.525 --> 00:00:17.787
technologies as well as people, to use
PIV and derived PIV, and to federate.

4
00:00:17.787 --> 00:00:21.738
The FICAM Architecture breaks
the same ground into services.

5
00:00:21.738 --> 00:00:26.126
This crosswalk maps both to the
workbook's books, guides and kits.

6
00:00:26.126 --> 00:00:29.689
It starts with nine identity
areas, from workforce and

7
00:00:29.689 --> 00:00:34.125
non-person identity to federation,
governance and public identity.

8
00:00:34.125 --> 00:00:39.500
Then it checks M-19-17 section by section
and the FICAM services one by one.

9
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:44.247
Across those forty-two rows, the
marks are 15 strong, 20 partial,

10
00:00:44.247 --> 00:00:48.900
5 gaps, and 2 deliberately out of
scope, with the reason stated.

11
00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:51.775
Every mark comes from
reading the linked pages.

12
00:00:51.775 --> 00:00:54.925
Identity is where most of
this program's work lands,

13
00:00:54.925 --> 00:00:59.125
so naming the gaps plainly matters
as much as showing the strengths.

14
00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:00.790
The page is in review.
